TITLE
FlukaToolkit example template — grid keys are #define'd and patched per combination
* Each grid parameter in sim.yaml must have a matching #define below.
#define beame 0.1
#define mat GALLIUM
* --- geometry / physics cards would go here in a real deck ---
BEAM        -beame                                                            ELECTRON
BEAMPOS          0.0       0.0      -1.0
* RANDOMIZ is rewritten with a unique seed per run by fluka-grid / fluka-submit
RANDOMIZ         1.0       1.0
* START primary count may be overridden via fluka.primaries in sim.yaml
START        10000.
STOP
